# The document build installs `docx` here by hand — see README.md for why it is
# deliberately absent from the application's package.json.
#
# The manifest and the lockfile ARE committed, and the installed tree is not.
# An unpinned dependency is an unpinned dependency whether or not a human
# types the command that installs it, and these documents go to customers.
node_modules/
# Rendered output lives in docs/, not beside the generator.
*.docx
*.pdf
*.jpg
